      "claim": "In the candidate Handle body, the handler awaits CustomerCheckoutSupport.LoadOwnedOrderAsync(dbContext, currentUser, query.OrderUuid, cancellationToken) and assigns its result to order before checking Square configuration. If either Square AppId or CallbackUrl is blank, the body returns CustomerSquareRetryResponse(0, null, null, \"Square is not configured in the new API.\").",
