    {
      "claim": "When those configuration values are present, the body computes cents from order.Total * 100, rounds midpoint values AwayFromZero, casts to int, and formats with invariant culture. It constructs payment data with that amount, USD, CallbackUrl + \"/customer/callback\", AppId as client_id, notes \"OrderID:\" plus the order UUID, and CREDIT_CARD as the supported tender; the complete data string is URI-escaped in the square-commerce-v1://payment/create deep link.",
